#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:2
msgid "Purpose-Built Collaboration"
msgstr "목적 특화 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:4
msgid ""
"From large-scale logistics operations to critical infrastructure defense,"
" organizations are under pressure to act faster, with fewer resources and"
" greater operational complexity. But legacy chat platforms and multi-"
"purpose messaging tools can't keep pace with dynamic, high-stakes "
"workflows. They lack the integration depth, security controls, and "
"mission-specific configurability needed for real-time operational "
"success."
msgstr ""
"대규모 물류 운영부터 핵심 인프라 방어까지, 조직은 더 적은 자원과 더 복잡한 운영 환경 "
"속에서 더 빠르게 움직여야 하는 압박을 받고 있습니다. 그러나 레거시 채팅 플랫폼과 다목적 "
"메시징 도구는 역동적인 고위험 워크플로를 따라가지 못합니다. 실시간 운영 성공에 필요한 "
"통합 깊이, 보안 통제, 임무별 구성 가능성이 부족하기 때문입니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Mattermost provides a purpose-built collaboration platform designed for "
"technical, operational, and industrial teams. It brings people, tools, "
"and workflows together in a secure, extensible environment—streamlining "
"coordination, improving decision velocity, and increasing resilience. "
"Whether coordinating a global logistics chain, managing operational "
"technology (OT) in the field, or running a security operations center, "
"Mattermost adapts to your environment—not the other way around."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 기술, 운영, 산업 팀을 위해 설계된 목적 특화 협업 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 사람, "
"도구, 워크플로를 안전하고 확장 가능한 환경에 모아 협조 체계를 간소화하고, 의사 결정 "
"속도를 높이고, 회복탄력성을 강화합니다. 글로벌 물류망 조율, 현장 운영 기술(OT) 관리, "
"보안 운영 센터 운영 등 어떤 상황에서도 OKR.BEST가 사용자의 환경에 맞춰 적응합니다 — 그 "
"반대가 아닙니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:8
msgid ""
"Secure, Mission-Focused Collaboration to Enable Faster, Informed "
"Decision-Making across Environments."
msgstr ""
"환경 전반에서 더 빠르고 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 가능하게 하는 안전한 임무 중심 협업."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:11
msgid "The following mission-ready collaboration capabilities are available:"
msgstr "다음과 같은 미션 레디 협업 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:14
msgid "Global Logistics Coordination"
msgstr "글로벌 물류 조율"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:16
msgid ""
"Coordinating logistics across continents, agencies, and time zones "
"requires a secure, unified platform that centralizes communications and "
"aligns stakeholders."
msgstr ""
"대륙, 기관, 시간대를 넘나드는 물류를 조율하려면 커뮤니케이션을 중앙화하고 이해관계자를 "
"정렬하는 안전한 통합 플랫폼이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:18
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:32
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:45
msgid "**Benefits**"
msgstr "**이점**"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Enable real-time coordination** across supply chains, procurement, and "
"field units with :doc:`channel-based messaging </end-user-guide"
"/messaging-collaboration>` and :doc:`playbook-driven workflows </end-"
"user-guide/workflow-automation>` that standardize communication and "
"reduce friction."
msgstr ""
"**실시간 협조 지원** — 커뮤니케이션을 표준화하고 마찰을 줄이는 :doc:`채널 기반 메시징 "
"</end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`\\ 과 :doc:`플레이북 기반 워크플로 "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 로 공급망, 조달, 현장 부대 전반을 "
"조율합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Connect systems across logistics networks** by integrating ERP, fleet "
"tracking, maintenance management, and transportation tools via "
":doc:`webhooks, APIs, and plugins </integrations-guide/integrations-"
"guide-index>`."
msgstr ""
"**물류 네트워크 전반의 시스템 연결** — :doc:`웹훅, API, 플러그인 "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 으로 ERP, 차량 추적, 유지보수 "
"관리, 운송 도구를 통합합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Preserve operational continuity** during outages or disruptions using "
":ref:`self-hosted deployments <deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-"
"planning:deployment options>` and :doc:`high availability architecture "
"</administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>`"
" that eliminate reliance on third-party cloud services."
msgstr ""
"**운영 연속성 보존** — 제3자 클라우드 서비스 의존을 없애는 :ref:`셀프 호스팅 배포 "
"<deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>`\\ 와 "
":doc:`고가용성 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-"
"based-deployment>`\\ 로 중단이나 장애 상황에서도 운영을 이어 갑니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Support multilingual coordination** with :ref:`localized UI options "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options:language>` in 20+"
" languages to ensure inclusive collaboration across global teams."
msgstr ""
"**다국어 협조 지원** — 20개 이상 언어의 :ref:`현지화된 UI 옵션 "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options:language>`\\ 으로 "
"글로벌 팀 전반의 포용적인 협업을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:26
msgid "Operational Technology and ICS Collaboration"
msgstr "운영 기술(OT) 및 ICS 협업"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:28
msgid ""
"OT and field operations in energy, utilities, manufacturing, and "
"transportation sectors demand secure, real-time communication across "
"widely distributed assets and personnel. From remote substations and "
"industrial facilities to on-site emergency repair teams, teams must "
"coordinate without exposing sensitive control systems or violating "
"compliance standards."
msgstr ""
"에너지, 유틸리티, 제조, 운송 부문의 OT 및 현장 운영에는 광범위하게 분산된 자산과 인력 "
"전반에 걸친 안전한 실시간 커뮤니케이션이 필요합니다. 원격 변전소와 산업 시설부터 현장 "
"긴급 수리 팀까지, 민감한 제어 시스템을 노출하거나 컴플라이언스 표준을 위반하지 않으면서 "
"협조해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:30
msgid ""
"Mattermost enables secure collaboration across OT environments and field "
"operations, even under disconnected, air-gapped, or constrained network "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 단절, 에어갭, 제한된 네트워크 조건에서도 OT 환경과 현장 운영 전반의 안전한 "
"협업을 가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Enable compliant, real-time OT communications** across operational "
"zones and facilities using :ref:`secure, on-prem collaboration "
"<deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>` "
"that keeps data within your control perimeter."
msgstr ""
"**컴플라이언스를 준수하는 실시간 OT 커뮤니케이션** — 데이터를 통제 경계 안에 유지하는 "
":ref:`안전한 온프레미스 협업 <deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-"
"planning:deployment options>`\\ 으로 운영 구역과 시설 전반을 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Support field teams with hardened mobile access** using :doc:`EMM-based"
" app provisioning </deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-using-emm-"
"provider>`, :ref:`biometric authentication <deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-security-features:biometric authentication>`, :ref:`jailbreak "
"detection <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-features:jailbreak and"
" root detection>`, and :ref:`ID-only push notifications <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:id-only push "
"notifications>`—ensuring that only authorized, uncompromised devices can "
"access operational data."
msgstr ""
"**강화된 모바일 접근으로 현장 팀 지원** — :doc:`EMM 기반 앱 프로비저닝 "
"</deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-using-emm-provider>`, "
":ref:`생체 인증 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-features:biometric "
"authentication>`, :ref:`탈옥 감지 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-"
"features:jailbreak and root detection>`, :ref:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:id-only "
"push notifications>`\\ 으로 승인되고 침해되지 않은 기기만 운영 데이터에 접근할 수 "
"있도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Integrate with industrial monitoring systems** like SCADA, PI "
"historians, and plant analytics using :doc:`alert-driven webhook and "
"plugin integrations </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` that "
"push system events to relevant mobile or desktop channels."
msgstr ""
"**산업 모니터링 시스템과 통합** — 시스템 이벤트를 관련 모바일·데스크톱 채널로 전달하는 "
":doc:`알림 기반 웹훅·플러그인 통합 </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-"
"index>`\\ 으로 SCADA, PI 히스토리언, 플랜트 분석 시스템과 연동합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Ensure system and network isolation** with :doc:`air-gapped deployment "
"support </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios"
"/air-gapped-deployment>` that allows full collaboration within OT "
"enclaves and disconnected environments."
msgstr ""
"**시스템·네트워크 격리 보장** — OT 영역과 단절 환경 안에서 완전한 협업을 가능하게 하는 "
":doc:`에어갭 배포 지원 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-"
"scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>`\\ 을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Prevent mobile data leakage** via :ref:`remote wipe capabilities "
"<security-guide/mobile-security:mobile device management (mdm)>` and "
":ref:`screenshot/screen recording prevention <deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-security-features:screenshot and screen recording prevention>` "
"for mobile devices used in the field."
msgstr ""
"**모바일 데이터 유출 방지** — 현장에서 사용하는 모바일 기기에 :ref:`원격 초기화 기능 "
"<security-guide/mobile-security:mobile device management (mdm)>`\\ 과 "
":ref:`스크린샷/화면 녹화 방지 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-security-"
"features:screenshot and screen recording prevention>`\\ 를 적용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:41
msgid "Technical Operational Command Centers"
msgstr "기술 운영 지휘 센터"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:43
msgid ""
"Engineering, infrastructure, and security teams manage increasingly "
"complex environments. Whether responding to incidents, deploying "
"software, or monitoring infrastructure, they need customizable workspaces"
" that reduce cognitive load and integrate the tools they trust."
msgstr ""
"엔지니어링, 인프라, 보안 팀은 갈수록 복잡해지는 환경을 관리합니다. 인시던트 대응, "
"소프트웨어 배포, 인프라 모니터링 등 어떤 업무에서든 인지 부담을 줄이고 신뢰하는 도구를 "
"통합할 수 있는 맞춤형 워크스페이스가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Accelerate decision-making and incident response** using "
":doc:`Collaborative Playbooks </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` to "
"automate workflows for triage, patching, code releases, and security "
"alerts."
msgstr ""
"**의사 결정과 인시던트 대응 가속화** — :doc:`협업 플레이북 "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 으로 분류, 패치, 코드 릴리스, 보안 알림 "
"워크플로를 자동화합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Customize your collaboration environment** with :doc:`theming </end-"
"user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme>`, :doc:`custom branding "
"</administration-guide/configure/custom-branding-tools>`, and "
":doc:`channel templates </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>` to "
"mirror internal teams and operational domains."
msgstr ""
"**협업 환경 커스터마이징** — :doc:`테마 설정 "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme>`, :doc:`사용자 정의 브랜딩 "
"</administration-guide/configure/custom-branding-tools>`, :doc:`채널 템플릿 "
"</end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`\\ 으로 내부 팀과 운영 도메인 구조를 "
"반영합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Extend platform capabilities** with :doc:`slash commands, bots, and "
"custom plugins </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` that "
"connect Mattermost to CI/CD systems, alerting frameworks, ticketing "
"platforms, and internal tools."
msgstr ""
"**플랫폼 기능 확장** — OKR.BEST를 CI/CD 시스템, 알림 프레임워크, 티켓팅 플랫폼, 내부 "
"도구와 연결하는 :doc:`슬래시 명령어, 봇, 사용자 정의 플러그인 "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 을 활용합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Increase usability and team cohesion** with :ref:`custom emojis <end-"
"user-guide/collaborate/react-with-emojis-gifs:upload custom emojis>`, "
"shared terminology, and :doc:`real-time messaging </end-user-guide"
"/messaging-collaboration>` optimized for platform engineers, DevSecOps "
"teams, and field service managers."
msgstr ""
"**사용성과 팀 결속력 강화** — :ref:`사용자 정의 이모지 "
"<end-user-guide/collaborate/react-with-emojis-gifs:upload custom "
"emojis>`, 공유 용어, 그리고 플랫폼 엔지니어·DevSecOps 팀·현장 서비스 관리자에 "
"최적화된 :doc:`실시간 메시징 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`\\ 을 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:53
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "시작하기"

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/purpose-built-collaboration.rst:55
msgid ""
"`Talk to an Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to create a "
"secure, purpose-built collaboration environment aligned with your "
"mission. Whether supporting distributed logistics, managing ICS "
"environments, or running an operational command center, Mattermost adapts"
" to your workflows—so your teams can move faster, respond smarter, and "
"deliver with confidence."
msgstr ""
"임무에 맞춘 안전한 목적 특화 협업 환경을 구축하려면 `전문가와 상담 "
"<https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 하세요. 분산 물류 지원, ICS 환경 관리, "
"운영 지휘 센터 운영 등 어떤 상황에서도 OKR.BEST는 워크플로에 맞춰 적응하므로, 팀은 더 "
"빠르게 움직이고, 더 똑똑하게 대응하고, 자신 있게 성과를 낼 수 있습니다."

